WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin', as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:05.230
Kurumi, I'll Teach You How To Date.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.380
What're you doing?!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.470
Putting away winter clothes!
What're you doing?!

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:21.550
What're you doing?!

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:25.090
I should've done it a bit sooner, 'cuz summer is coming soon!

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:28.240
Hmm... Summer is coming, eh...

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.750
What happened?!

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.960
Wh...What the hell are you doing?!

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.160
Why, you... Kurumi!
Wh...What the hell are you doing?!

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:38.240
Wh...What the hell are you doing?!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:43.430
'Cuz! 'Cuz! I wanted to repaint the patterns in the room!

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:46.430
Kurumi! You were using
the Power just now, weren't you!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.680
'Cuz! 'Cuz! I thought it'd finish
the job quicker! Guess I goofed, huh?

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.250
What a troublemaker you are!
Put everything back where it was!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.390
Uh-huh.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.400
I...Idiot! Don't use the Power!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.540
H...Hey! Put me down!

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.570
In the end, the room was left unchanged...

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.540
No-no! 'Cause outdoors is full of cars!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.980
I'm pooped!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.940
Kurumi had used up all her Power.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.710
But, who could know how that
would affect what happened next?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.670
No one could even imagine that it could happen.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.580
Say, what wallpaper do you want?

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.220
The Arabesque-patterned one.
Say, what wallpaper do you want?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:05.400
The Arabesque-patterned one.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.190
"The Arabesque-patterned one?!"

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.800
Maybe you need some rest, Kurumi.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.820
I wonder if I do...

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.030
I'm sorry.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:19.500
Okay?
I'm sorry.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.610
Oh! This is gorgeous!

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:27.370
This one's nice too!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.970
Yeah!
This one's nice too!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:29.040
Hey! Let's get this one!
Yeah!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.840
Hey! Let's get this one!

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.440
Hmm... Will it match your room?
Hey! Let's get this one!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.810
Hmm... Will it match your room?

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.950
Will you please make up your minds,
like right now!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:40.040
With girls, this is something
you just have to put up with!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:59.560
Wh... What the hell do you want?!

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:16.260
Say, Madoka? How about
something like this?

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:18.800
Hmm...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.420
Nice, but... I dunno...

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.240
Not me?

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:26.740
Well, you'll feel miserable
wearing it if you aren't full-chested.

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:30.890
Oh, no... Gee, you're mean!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.900
Say... What do you think about this one?

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.610
On second thought... Maybe not.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.740
Darling!
On second thought... Maybe not.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:42.810
Oh... Hi!
Darling!

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.020
Oh... Hi!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:47.220
Sh... Shopping together?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.450
Yes! Oh, what great timing!
Sh... Shopping together?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:50.530
Sh... Shopping together?

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.780
Why don't we have Kasuga-sempai help us pick out the best, eh?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.220
Huh...? Sure...

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:59.190
Oh! Darling, if you don't mind!

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.830
Pl...Please let me help you too!

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:12.150
Oniichan!

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:15.410
Oniichan, where are you?! Come over here, quick!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:21.940
Say what?! Kurumi was
taken away by some stranger?!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.360
It's true...

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.530
She disappeared while I was
talking to a clerk about wallpaper...

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.230
...and when I looked around for her,
I asked people, and...

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:33.290
...they said that a man
wearing sunglasses took her away.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.040
A man wearing sunglasses?!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.100
We'd better go look for her right away!

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:40.780
It'll be awful if she
gets attacked or something!

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.500
Well... I'm not too worried about that.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.440
The truth is that I'm afraid of the reverse...!

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.800
We've gotta find her, before it's too late...

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:07.810
Y'know, Kurumi used up
all her Power this morning!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:11.280
Oh! I forgot about that! Oh, no!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.930
Kasuga... we'll go with you
and help you out!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.310
Yeah! I'll help too!

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.860
I... I'm gonna help too!
Yeah! I'll help too!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:16.940
Yeah! I'll help too!

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.490
"Oniisan!"

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.050
Was Kurumi... abducted?!

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:25.340
It's... It's not definite yet...
Hey, where did you ooze out from?!

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:29.310
So... the man who took Kurumi away...
What was he like?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.280
One of the girls who saw him said...

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.770
He looked like a sex-maniac, wore sunglasses...

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:40.020
...had big lips, and a face full of acne!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.440
That's GODAWFUL!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.340
Manami, let's go look for her!
You go with Kurumi!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:50.540
Okay! Well, then... Huh?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.870
Hey, you cheater!
How can I go with Kurumi?!

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.400
Are you okay?

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.490
Yeah...
Are you okay?

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:26.280
There he is!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.800
There he is!
There he is!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:27.860
There he is!

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.790
H...Hey you! Wh... Where did you hide Kurumi?!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.760
Say what?! Who the hell are you?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.290
D...Don't act innocent!

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.250
A guy who perfectly fits your description kidnapped my little sister!

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:40.720
What?!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.300
Are you accusing me of
somethin' I didn't do?!

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:48.840
You got some nerve, guy!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.870
Sabu, stop it!

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:52.060
What?!
Sabu, stop it!

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:58.180
Miss Ayukawa... Er... er...

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.650
I didn't realize... Is he a friend of yours?

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:04.990
Please, I apologize! I didn't know
he was a friend of yours, Ayukawa.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:11.450
I am really sorry! I mean, your friend blurted out some crazy things, so...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:18.200
I really... know nothing about this gentleman's sister.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:23.060
Yo! Guys! Anyone know anybody
who tried to mess with a "Kurumi?"

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:23.730
What? I have no idea, man...

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:24.830
I wouldn't know...

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:25.500
Do you know?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.500
I don't know of anyone..

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.070
I don't know either...

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.470
I haven't a clue...

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:28.550
I don't know either...

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:32.920
"l don't know" ain't no help! Get with it! Go check it out!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.920
Sabu... You don't have to do this.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:37.520
Oh, it's perfectly all right!

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.950
Anyway, those guys have nothing better to do, so...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.910
Sabu...

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.680
Ayukawa never ceases to amaze me!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:51.330
Isn't this great? They're all willing to help!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.740
Huh? O...Oh!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.640
By "never ceasing to amaze me," I didn't just mean that...

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:02.580
...she's someone very important or that she's always one step ahead...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.080
...but, you see...

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:10.270
But, at any rate... I had absolutely no idea where Kurumi might be.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:16.310
So I'm just following Ayukawa
and Hikaru around looking for her.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:23.690
As her big brother, I'm ashamed that I can't do better.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:31.160
I'm sure that we'll find Kurumi.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.150
Ayukawa... I got a lead that a girl fitting Kurumi's description...

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:38.640
...was seen at a Cherry Street crepe shop with a man wearing sunglasses.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.310
Cherry Street?!

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:40.940
Wait...
Cherry Street?!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:41.700
Huh?
Wait...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:41.780
Huh?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.890
I'm sure that we'll be getting more reports from all over.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.390
It'd be better if you remain here
a little longer, Kasuga.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.590
Hikaru, you go and check out Cherry Street.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.460
Sure!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.610
Oh! It's dangerous to go alone!
So I'll go with you!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.520
Hikaru!

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.600
I feel awful imposing on everyone.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.610
When we're in trouble,
we count on each other.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:06.790
That Kurumi... As soon as she's found,
I'll have words with her!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:09.910
I envy that...

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.030
Envy what?
I envy that...

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:11.710
Oh, no... It's nothing.
Envy what?

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:14.440
Oh, no... It's nothing.

00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.750
Ayukawa! Bad news!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:21.050
What?
Ayukawa! Bad news!

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:21.130
Ayukawa! Bad news!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:23.090
The Sunglasses Guy and a girl
fitting Kurumi's description were...

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.720
...seen together at the "Lovers' Forest"
near Shinmachi Ave!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.380
The "Lovers' Forest?!"

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:31.860
Yeah... I'm told that they were walking right by it.

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:33.630
Sabu, take care of everyone, okay?

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.100
Y... Yes...

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:34.170
Sabu, take care of everyone, okay?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.510
Er... What's the "Lovers' Forest?"

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.100
Go there and you'll figure it out!

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:39.300
Thanks...

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.270
That way!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:51.640
Right here!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.350
Kurumi!

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:01.110
Where are you?!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.690
When he said "Lovers' Forest..."

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.440
...I guess this is the kind of
a place that he meant.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:30.130
It's supposed to be
just another normal park...

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:32.230
...but somehow it ended up like this.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.420
Now it's kind of embarrassing... to come in here.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:37.450
What can I do for you?

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:07.190
I don't think this is the kind of place kids like you ought to come to.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.570
A girl like the one you're looking for didn't come in here.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:12.470
So, why don't you leave at once?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.580
But, sir, the park is so big... What if...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:19.050
Listen! We do a check at the entrance.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.170
I'm telling you, she didn't come in here.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:29.490
Or, maybe... you made up this
"looking for my little sister" story...

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.540
...when really, you just wanted to come in here on a date?

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.870
What?!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.520
You're wrong! Let's go!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.200
Ayukawa was embarrassed,
and when I saw people staring...

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.500
...I really wanted to have
a word or two with them, but...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:15.660
...the truth is that...
seeing Ayukawa embarrassed...

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.440
...was rather charming.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:23.540
"Lesson 1: In the Coffee Shop"
...was rather charming.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.520
"To invite a girl to go into a coffee-shop with you...

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.220
"...you should lead her by either holding her hand casually, or...

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.820
"...placing your hand around her waist."

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:34.620
"Rather than sitting across a table from each other...

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.330
"...the counter is more intimate
and permits occasional bodily contact."

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:41.590
"Thus she will feel more comfortable, and she'll be more receptive to you."

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.790
All right! I'll do that this time!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:49.110
"Also, when she becomes tipsy, after a round of drinks...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.310
'Well? Wanna go someplace a little nicer?'

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.680
"Say something to that effect
in order to make her go with you.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.280
" 'No...?' Even if she refuses and says that,
you should repeatedly say...

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:58.600
" 'C'mon, let's go...', as assuming
control of the situation works best."

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:06.420
Young man! What's the meaning of this?!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.010
Oh! It's just... er...
Young man! What's the meaning of this?!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:08.090
Young man! What's the meaning of this?!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.960
I don't want my merchandise played around with!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.050
I... I'm sorry, sir!

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:23.720
Ah! Sorry about having made you wait!

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.400
Oh! This is so good!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.560
What the...!
Oh! This is so good!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:28.640
Oh! This is so good!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.760
W... Will you get your cat off the chair?!

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.870
I guess it won't work
like it did in the video...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.590
Say... Wanna have some more drinks?

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.230
I want something more to eat!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:45.800
Wh... Oh... O... Okay...

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:47.550
Hey! We need to add an order over here! Over here!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:51.270
Lemmesee now... Pizza-Toast, a Cutlet-Sandwich...

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:54.200
...then... a Mimosa Salad,
Pineapple Juice...

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.500
...and then, lemmesee...
a large Corn Soup for Jingoro!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.870
I haven't seen a girl like that.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.430
I see. Thank you very much.
I haven't seen a girl like that.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.820
What the hell do you want?

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.960
I am looking for a kidnapper who's wearing sunglasses.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:14.140
Beat it!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.330
How could you... at a time like this...?
Are you all right?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.160
I... I'm dying...

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:31.090
Say... Do you really think that Kurumi might be somewhere around here?

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:35.080
My gut feelings are...
usually right on target!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:38.900
No doubt about it! I'm sure that she's somewhere in this park.

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.010
I wonder...

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.270
Definitely!
I wonder...

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:42.350
I wonder...

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.190
To be riding on a boat alone with a girl...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.520
There's nothing more fun than this!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:51.900
Though... somehow we seem
to be going to a more remote area.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:52.780
Huh?!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.500
Hey... Shouldn't we go look someplace that has more people?

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.800
Oh, no!

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.910
If there aren't many people,
it's more dangerous, you see!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.730
That's the reason why we must look for them around here!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:12.180
That was good! Did I eat or what?!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:14.510
Oh, boy, am I stuffed!
That was a treat, huh?

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.490
'S...Scuse me... Huh?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.850
500 for the video rental...
'S...Scuse me... Huh?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:26.930
'S...Scuse me... Huh?

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:32.220
...spaghetti, iced-milk, pizza-toast, cutlet-sandwich and...

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:35.830
What are you doing?

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.280
What are you doing? O... Oh! Nothing!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.710
Say, why don't we get outta here and go someplace a little nicer?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:40.600
A nicer place?

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.730
I... I mean, a fun place!
A nicer place?

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:43.210
Yippee! Let's go!
I... I mean, a fun place!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.070
Yippee! Let's go!

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.040
Huh? Really?!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.740
Yup!
Huh? Really?!

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.170
Yup!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.950
Let's go then!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.000
Come on! Come on!
Let's go then!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.090
Somehow things just don't go the way they do in the video!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:00.350
Still, things are looking up, it seems!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.850
Ayukawa!

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.100
It doesn't look good!
We can't find anyone...

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.410
...who's seen a girl fitting Kurumi's description!

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:10.070
I see...

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.760
That Kurumi... Where could she be?!
I see...

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:11.860
I see...

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.660
I just hope... that she wasn't
taken away in a car or something!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:15.510
What?!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.270
We'll go look for her some more!
What?!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:17.270
We'll go look for her some more!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:20.500
But, I feel bad about
bothering you guys so much.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.940
We ain't doin' it for you!

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:28.760
We're... doing it for Ayukawa.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:31.060
You see, once...
a long time ago, Ayukawa...

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.130
Sabu!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.570
Excuse me. I'll go look for her.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.230
He's a nice guy...

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:37.950
They're all...
He's a nice guy...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.000
Huh?
They're all...

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:39.130
Huh?

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:41.470
...my friends.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.860
Come on now. We'd better go look for her as well.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.710
Oh! Beau-ti-ful!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:04.040
Sheesh! After all the trouble
I went through, we end up here!

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:07.530
"Girls are defenseless
when in a pleasant mood."

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:09.560
"They're most vulnerable at sunset..."

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.260
All right! That's it!
"They're most vulnerable at sunset..."

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:18.210
It sure is quiet. This sunset...
it's as if it's blessing both of us.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:22.780
What the...? K... Kurumi?

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.820
Ushiko... wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.970
Umao... wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.590
'Scuze us!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:40.860
Jingoro! Jingoro! This way! Jingoro!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.520
Don't you see, that kind of thing is meant to be done, not seen!

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:53.630
Kurumi!

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:57.600
She couldn't... possibly have been...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.890
What am I to do?!

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:05.020
Looks like we'll have to go to the police.

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.170
Yeah...

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.590
Jingoro!

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:14.060
Weren't you with Kurumi?!
Where is Kurumi?!

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:17.440
She must be around here somewhere.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.550
Kurumi... I hope you're all right...

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:27.640
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.800
Jingoro? Where are you?

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:35.950
Kurumi...

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.670
Huh?
Kurumi...

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:37.750
Kurumi...

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.340
Let's perform a love scene together! What would you say?

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.380
Jingoro...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:50.040
That's Kurumi's voice! Kurumi!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.920
It came from over there...

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.960
Oh! Did you just hear Kurumi scream?

00:20:55.960 --> 00:21:00.240
Huh? Hmm... If we stay here, she might happen by.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:03.400
Let me see now... Why don't you...

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.850
Hey, the culprit's dropping in...

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.450
Kurumi!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:27.560
Kurumi!

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:33.230
Kurumi!

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.070
Are you hurt?!

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:38.700
No...pe!
Are you hurt?!

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:46.680
Just when it was getting good! How dare you! You're mine!

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.780
I... I didn't mean any harm!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:52.190
Wh... Why it's...

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:54.350
B... Bro!

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:07.410
Sheesh... Kurumi's kidnapper was Komatsu's big brother?!

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:12.350
We were stunned by this strange
twist of fate; it seemed so moronic!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.900
But, regardless...

00:22:14.340 --> 00:22:18.570
But, regardless... What WERE you thinking,
going off with a guy?

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:20.250
Sorry!

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:21.340
But, it's a little odd...
Sorry!

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:22.250
What is?
But, it's a little odd...

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:22.330
What is?

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:25.290
Kurumi used up all her Power this morning...

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.850
...so she shouldn't have been able to use it, I thought.

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:30.790
Oh! Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:22:31.390 --> 00:22:33.970
After he treated me to lots of food, I was all charged up again!

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:38.140
Oh, I'm jealous! Lucky you!
So, what did you get to eat?!

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:40.330
Lemmesee, cutlet-sandwich, and all kinds of stuff!

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:41.740
Lucky you!

00:22:41.740 --> 00:22:44.210
Everything turned out okay.
Lucky you!

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:50.140
Never before had my feelings towards Ayukawa been...

00:22:56.690 --> 00:22:59.210
What?! Hikaru's at the hospital?!

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:04.160
Apparently, Yuusaku got hurt.
Anyway, she wants you to go there.

00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:05.620
Okay. I'll go right over.

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:09.560
"Nakayama General Hospital"

00:23:12.800 --> 00:23:14.980
Here. Say "Ah!"

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:18.400
One more. Say "Ah!"

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:25.270
It had been a long, busy day, full of all sorts of events.

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:33.020
Darling!

00:23:54.980 --> 00:24:02.590
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.590 --> 00:24:10.170
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:25.510
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.510 --> 00:24:38.130
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.130 --> 00:24:48.340
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:55.340
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.340 --> 00:25:06.750
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:13.260 --> 00:25:18.270
The "Energized-All-Day Girl" Hikaru suddenly collapsed at school!

00:25:18.270 --> 00:25:21.170
It happened just like in a dream that I had this morning.

00:25:21.170 --> 00:25:23.860
What if everything happens
just like in the rest of the dream?!

00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:26.880
Oh... what'll happen to Hikaru?!

00:25:26.880 --> 00:25:30.130
Next time: "A Foreboding Dream?!
Hikaru is Dying."
